        "duration_seconds": 26.411,
        "asr_text": "The real question is not fixed desks or shared desks. It is what makes a place work? One person needs a steady point. It removes the need to search every day. Another needs enough control to change the people nearby and the workspace. The seat is only the visible part of a deeper question. What makes a worker feel, this is my place at work?",
